  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836456",
      "title": "Module Introduction & Starting Project",
      "sourceHash": "b67c9da848f3a93bccfc88a5f36fe55c1adb7fc2c89f626a3caec3781280abb1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.08,
          "end": 2.97,
          "en": "This course section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.97,
          "end": 5.91,
          "en": "will be another practice section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.91,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "where you can practice all these basics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 11.209,
          "en": "and also more advanced concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.209,
          "end": 14.1,
          "en": "you learned up to this point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 17.22,
          "en": "And in this section, we're going to build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.22,
          "end": 22.05,
          "en": "this React Project Management application here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.05,
          "end": 27.05,
          "en": "where you can create projects, add tasks to projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.99,
          "end": 30.99,
          "en": "and view different projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.99,
          "end": 35.313,
          "en": "And where you can also clear tasks and delete projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.18,
          "end": 37.83,
          "en": "And whilst this is, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.83,
          "end": 41.07,
          "en": "a fairly basic application still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.07,
          "end": 43.835,
          "en": "you will see that it combines many of these features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.835,
          "end": 47.31,
          "en": "you learned about up to this point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.31,
          "end": 49.26,
          "en": "For building this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.26,
          "end": 52.56,
          "en": "you will need to work with Components and State,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.56,
          "end": 57.21,
          "en": "but also probably with Refs and Portals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.21,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "And of course, you'll also need to apply some Styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 64.5,
          "en": "And whilst we will build this application together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 67.68,
          "en": "step by step throughout this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.68,
          "end": 71.43,
          "en": "I strongly recommend that you also take it as a challenge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.43,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "and that you try to build this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "this app on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 81.12,
          "en": "or at least try to get as far as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.12,
          "end": 85.08,
          "en": "And keep in mind that there is no wrong solution here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.08,
          "end": 89.61,
          "en": "Simply find a solution, and then take a look at my solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.61,
          "end": 94.61,
          "en": "and see how I built this and why I made certain choices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.86,
          "end": 97.32,
          "en": "Now, attached to this lecture here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.32,
          "end": 99.66,
          "en": "you'll find a starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.66,
          "end": 102.6,
          "en": "both a local and a CodeSandbox version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.6,
          "end": 105.273,
          "en": "And of course, as always the two versions are equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.11,
          "end": 107.43,
          "en": "For the local version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.43,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "you need to install the dependencies first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 113.733,
          "en": "And then, of course, also starts the dev server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 118.22999999999999,
          "en": "For CodeSandbox, as always, you don't have to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.22999999999999,
          "end": 121.263,
          "en": "and you should then see something like this on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.19,
          "end": 127.19,
          "en": "And this project will also use Tailwind CSS for styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "That's why you find these small utility classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 134.85,
          "en": "on this H1 element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.85,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "Now, the starting project I prepared for you here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 141.15,
          "en": "already has Tailwind CSS installed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.15,
          "end": 143.25,
          "en": "So, you can use that project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.25,
          "end": 145.113,
          "en": "without installing it on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.04,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "And if you do follow my recommendation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 150.45,
          "en": "and you try building this on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.45,
          "end": 151.98,
          "en": "you should therefore also check out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.98,
          "end": 154.924,
          "en": "the official Tailwind documentation to see which classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.924,
          "end": 157.983,
          "en": "can be added to achieve a certain look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.85,
          "end": 161.4,
          "en": "Though if you don't wanna dive into that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.4,
          "end": 164.64,
          "en": "if you're not interested in it, that's of course also fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.64,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "Just build an ugly version of this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 169.512,
          "en": "and just make sure that it works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.512,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "like the project I showed you a couple of seconds ago.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "Because that's of course the most important part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 178.59,
          "en": "You should get the React code right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.59,
          "end": 181.263,
          "en": "The styling is not that important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 185.55,
          "en": "And therefore, definitely try this on your own first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.55,
          "end": 189.213,
          "en": "Starting with the next lecture, I'll show you my solution.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}